---
const { prefix = '' } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="institution-block" aria-labelledby={`${prefix}institution-heading`}>
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Why RESI, why now</p>
    <h2 id={`${prefix}institution-heading`}>Academic independence with institutional focus</h2>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p>
      RESI combines academic independence with sustained institutional focus on the foundational
      problems of advanced AI safety. We bring together researchers from across fields around shared
      questions, while remaining focused and flexible to respond as AI capabilities and
      architectures evolve.
    </p>
    <p>
      The architecture and norms surrounding advanced AI are still being formed. Research developed
      during this period has an opportunity to shape systems before their designs are entrenched.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/about#institution">
      Why an independent institute
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
